rived turn surface\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:191:└── derived-archive-views-section.ts          # NEW: structural derived-view surface\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:194:└── bootstrap.ts                              # MODIFIED: route archive actions to process/archive surfaces\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:197:├── fixtures/archive.ts                       # NEW: archive/turn/view fixtures\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:198:├── service/server/archive-api.test.ts        # NEW: Fastify archive route tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:199:├── service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts # NEW: finalization and idempotency tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:200:├── service/server/turn-derivation.test.ts    # NEW: deterministic turn derivation tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:201:├── service/client/archive-section.test.ts    # NEW: client archive rendering tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:202:├── service/client/archive-turns-section.test.ts # NEW: turn surface rendering tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:203:└── service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts # NEW: derived-view UI tests\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:210:| `convex/archiveEntries.ts` | New | Append/read canonical entries, sequence assignment, idempotency guard, pagination | Convex schema | AC-1.x, AC-2.3, AC-3.x, AC-7.3 |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:211:| `convex/archiveTurns.ts` | New | Store rebuildable cached turns | Convex schema | AC-4.x, AC-7.1 |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:212:| `convex/derivedArchiveViews.